Date: Fri, 22 Aug 2025 16:03:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 062/190] Revert "arm64: mm: Don't call __add_pages() for
 reserved memory"

commit ea255429f601182c15e27c536c16cbcea36b96c8 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

This broke the ability to xl create a Xen domU utilizing extended
regions for grant table mappings.

